{
  "_comment": [
    "The PermissionRequest hook payload — the wire shape that turns a Claude Code",
    "permission prompt into an ANSWERABLE record.",
    "",
    "Two readers pick DIFFERENT fields off the same frame, so a CLI rename breaks",
    "exactly one of them unless both are pinned here. claudemon",
    "(session/state.rs::apply) reads tool_name and summary|message and is the ONLY",
    "thing that can put a PTY session into SessionMode::Approval; the desktop",
    "(sessionStore/hookEventRouter.ts) reads tool_name, tool_input and",
    "permission_suggestions to render the card the user actually clicks.",
    "",
    "`registerable` is normative too, and is the field that was WRONG:",
    "HookEventKind::REGISTERABLE filed PermissionRequest as \"internal /",
    "forward-compat only\", so claudemon init never wrote the hook into",
    "~/.claude/settings.json — and a PTY agent's permission prompt therefore",
    "produced no approvable record at all. Blocked, visible, killable, but not",
    "answerable. Verified against CLI 2.1.237."
  ],
  "vocabulary": {
    "_comment": [
      "THE BLOCK REGISTRY. Every array-of-objects block in this file must be",
      "declared here and everything here must be a block — closure in both",
      "directions. Held by cmd/brain/corpusvocab_test.go and",
      "apps/desktop/src/main/services/contractsVocabulary.test.ts."
    ],
    "blocks": {
      "cases": {
        "why": "One PermissionRequest hook payload, and the approvable record each reader must build from it. Every case must yield one on BOTH sides: the failure this corpus exists to prevent is not a wrong card, it is NO card behind a prompt the CLI is blocked on.",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "payload",
          "claudemon",
          "desktop"
        ],
        "nested": {
          "claudemon": [
            "mode",
            "pendingKind",
            "tool",
            "summary"
          ],
          "desktop": [
            "ambientState",
            "toolName",
            "toolInput",
            "suggestions"
          ]
        },
        "loaders": [
          "services/claudemon/src/session/state.rs::permission_request_contract_cases",
          "apps/desktop/src/main/services/sessionStore/permissionRequestContract.test.ts::desktop reader"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "hookEventName": "PermissionRequest",
  "registerable": true,
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "tool_name + summary — the ordinary prompt",
      "payload": {
        "tool_name": "Write",
        "tool_input": {
          "file_path": "/tmp/config.yaml"
        },
        "summary": "Overwrite config file"
      },
      "claudemon": {
        "mode": "approval",
        "pendingKind": "approval",
        "tool": "Write",
        "summary": "Overwrite config file"
      },
      "desktop": {
        "ambientState": "waiting_approval",
        "toolName": "Write",
        "toolInput": {
          "file_path": "/tmp/config.yaml"
        },
        "suggestions": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "no summary — `message` is the fallback spelling",
      "payload": {
        "tool_name": "Bash",
        "tool_input": {
          "command": "rm -rf /tmp/x"
        },
        "message": "Run dangerous command"
      },
      "claudemon": {
        "mode": "approval",
        "pendingKind": "approval",
        "tool": "Bash",
        "summary": "Run dangerous command"
      },
      "desktop": {
        "ambientState": "waiting_approval",
        "toolName": "Bash",
        "toolInput": {
          "command": "rm -rf /tmp/x"
        },
        "suggestions": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "out-of-roots read — the shape the unresolvable-approval bug was reported on",
      "payload": {
        "tool_name": "Read",
        "tool_input": {
          "file_path": "/home/u/.workspacer/brief.md"
        },
        "summary": "Path is outside allowed working directories"
      },
      "claudemon": {
        "mode": "approval",
        "pendingKind": "approval",
        "tool": "Read",
        "summary": "Path is outside allowed working directories"
      },
      "desktop": {
        "ambientState": "waiting_approval",
        "toolName": "Read",
        "toolInput": {
          "file_path": "/home/u/.workspacer/brief.md"
        },
        "suggestions": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "permission_suggestions ride through to the card (desktop-only field)",
      "payload": {
        "tool_name": "Read",
        "tool_input": {
          "file_path": "/etc/hosts"
        },
        "summary": "Read a file outside the project",
        "permission_suggestions": [
          {
            "type": "addRules",
            "rules": [
              {
                "toolName": "Read"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "claudemon": {
        "mode": "approval",
        "pendingKind": "approval",
        "tool": "Read",
        "summary": "Read a file outside the project"
      },
      "desktop": {
        "ambientState": "waiting_approval",
        "toolName": "Read",
        "toolInput": {
          "file_path": "/etc/hosts"
        },
        "suggestions": [
          {
            "type": "addRules",
            "rules": [
              {
                "toolName": "Read"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "degenerate payload — still an approvable record, never a dropped prompt",
      "payload": {
        "summary": "something"
      },
      "claudemon": {
        "mode": "approval",
        "pendingKind": "approval",
        "tool": null,
        "summary": "something"
      },
      "desktop": {
        "ambientState": "waiting_approval",
        "toolName": "",
        "toolInput": {},
        "suggestions": null
      }
    }
  ]
}
